(2806546, 391363, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  TOok me a second to realize what it was.  Great work and I LOVE the soft focus.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  TOok me a second to realize what it was.  Great work and I LOVE the soft focus.', '2006-09-06 17:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
