(2807413, 391780, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the background with the nice moody skies.  The texture in the foreground with the dried out dirt is interesting.  The dog is positioned well for this composition and appears to be in focus.  What I do find distracting is the image seems flat and in need of more contrast (could be this monitor) and while the B/W theme is good, the range is short (not a true black or true white).  Overall, job well done.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Ok.  I took another peek using my home PC, which is properly calibrated...the range in this image looks MUCH better here.  ;^)  I wonder if I can get my boss to spring for a new monitor at work?  Hmmm...she might wonder why, then what do I say?  He-he.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the background with the nice moody skies.  The texture in the foreground with the dried out dirt is interesting.  The dog is positioned well for this composition and appears to be in focus.  What I do find distracting is the image seems flat and in need of more contrast (could be this monitor) and while the B/W theme is good, the range is short (not a true black or true white).  Overall, job well done.  Good luck in the challenge. Ok.  I took another peek using my home PC, which is properly calibrated...the range in this image looks MUCH better here.  ;^)  I wonder if I can get my boss to spring for a new monitor at work?  Hmmm...she might wonder why, then what do I say?  He-he.', '2006-09-06 21:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
