(2808602, 391532, 57384, '<td valign="top">You sure those lines are even, I''m thinking DNMC...<br/>...or not. This isn''t the most exciting picture in the world (just a pot), but I''m going to give you a higher score for the title and for the bold statement. The sets of lines are actually fairly interesting in a way.</td>', 'You sure those lines are even, I''m thinking DNMC......or not. This isn''t the most exciting picture in the world (just a pot), but I''m going to give you a higher score for the title and for the bold statement. The sets of lines are actually fairly interesting in a way.', '2006-09-07 01:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808624, 388721, 57384, '<td valign="top">The unfortunate thing on this site is that you have to mention the bird in the title of the photo (people won''t give you the benefit of the doubt). For me the bird is so minor that I would never (or almost never) notice it, but once it is mentioned in the title it becomes distracting. What I''m saying is it shouldn''t be in the title.<br/>It is an interesting photo otherwise. I don''t often agree with black &amp; white, but I do think it was well used here. Rule of thirds draws your eyes to the woman very well.</td>', 'The unfortunate thing on this site is that you have to mention the bird in the title of the photo (people won''t give you the benefit of the doubt). For me the bird is so minor that I would never (or almost never) notice it, but once it is mentioned in the title it becomes distracting. What I''m saying is it shouldn''t be in the title.It is an interesting photo otherwise. I don''t often agree with black & white, but I do think it was well used here. Rule of thirds draws your eyes to the woman very well.', '2006-09-07 01:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808650, 391419, 57384, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a picture. However the fire just doesn''t look real. Even though it probably is, the way it is processed makes it look not really like fire (like it''s photoshopped in kind of). Part of that is the lack of color. For me it doesn''t work very well.</td>', 'Great idea for a picture. However the fire just doesn''t look real. Even though it probably is, the way it is processed makes it look not really like fire (like it''s photoshopped in kind of). Part of that is the lack of color. For me it doesn''t work very well.', '2006-09-07 01:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2808658, 391392, 57384, '<td valign="top">I think some people are going to tell you the bright rocks are distracting, but I won''t. I don''t mind the contrast between the front and the back. I love the colors in this picture.</td>', 'I think some people are going to tell you the bright rocks are distracting, but I won''t. I don''t mind the contrast between the front and the back. I love the colors in this picture.', '2006-09-07 01:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
