(2809013, 389921, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like frogs, and usually images of them really grab my heart. I find this one to be lacking in punch though as there really isnt much contrast here. The other problem is the composition. To meet the rule of thirds, the frog should not be so centered, as that is your subject. I think it would do better if the frog was along the lines of thirds both horizontally and vetically.</td>', 'I like frogs, and usually images of them really grab my heart. I find this one to be lacking in punch though as there really isnt much contrast here. The other problem is the composition. To meet the rule of thirds, the frog should not be so centered, as that is your subject. I think it would do better if the frog was along the lines of thirds both horizontally and vetically.', '2006-09-07 05:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
