(2809874, 390586, 51653, '<td valign="top">Even if I like the idea and the composition, I find the fly too little and the negative space a bit too extended.</td>', 'Even if I like the idea and the composition, I find the fly too little and the negative space a bit too extended.', '2006-09-07 11:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
