(2809981, 391317, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Thrilling image!!!!  I would love to fish there!</b> <br/> <i>Technical elements:</i>  The horizon line is only slightly off-center, so I''m going to assume that was not equal to your "Rule of Thirds" idea.  <i>The fisherman &amp; the High-Key white spot above him in the clouds are both near the two R1/3 points on the right side of the photo.</i>  As such they seem to "play off" of each other in a near mirror-image sort of way.  Nice balance and interplay of elements.  <i>I am especially taken by the clouds that seem to form a fan-shape whose origin is approximately "dead center" of the composition.</i>  The ripples in the water appear to be mirroring the effect once again.<br/> <b>Photography at its finest!!!!   Great job!!!</b></td>', 'Thrilling image!!!!  I would love to fish there!  Technical elements:  The horizon line is only slightly off-center, so I''m going to assume that was not equal to your "Rule of Thirds" idea.  The fisherman & the High-Key white spot above him in the clouds are both near the two R1/3 points on the right side of the photo.  As such they seem to "play off" of each other in a near mirror-image sort of way.  Nice balance and interplay of elements.  I am especially taken by the clouds that seem to form a fan-shape whose origin is approximately "dead center" of the composition.  The ripples in the water appear to be mirroring the effect once again. Photography at its finest!!!!   Great job!!!', '2006-09-07 11:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2809988, 391515, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Amazing close-up of the moon!</b>  That must be some high-powered telescope at your disposal!  Is it located at the top of a big hill or mountain with a building surrounding its base?  ;)</td>', 'Amazing close-up of the moon!  That must be some high-powered telescope at your disposal!  Is it located at the top of a big hill or mountain with a building surrounding its base?  ;)', '2006-09-07 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
