(2810080, 390941, 32345, '<td valign="top">I love it, great composition. It''s a strong picture that meets the challenge really well.</td>', 'I love it, great composition. It''s a strong picture that meets the challenge really well.', '2006-09-07 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810081, 391314, 32345, '<td valign="top">Beautifull. I love the composition, Well done</td>', 'Beautifull. I love the composition, Well done', '2006-09-07 12:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810082, 391532, 64175, '<td valign="top">Can it get anymore rule of thirds than this? Great job.</td>', 'Can it get anymore rule of thirds than this? Great job.', '2006-09-07 12:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810083, 391532, 32345, '<td valign="top">Nice title, but it does meet the challenge. :)</td>', 'Nice title, but it does meet the challenge. :)', '2006-09-07 12:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810085, 391166, 64175, '<td valign="top">Butterfly/Moth seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Butterfly/Moth seems a bit out of focus.', '2006-09-07 12:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810088, 391767, 64175, '<td valign="top">Subject is not quite crisp enough. All fade into background instead of what is behind subject.</td>', 'Subject is not quite crisp enough. All fade into background instead of what is behind subject.', '2006-09-07 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810092, 391666, 64175, '<td valign="top">Thought it was an add for the Food Network.</td>', 'Thought it was an add for the Food Network.', '2006-09-07 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810180, 391779, 51222, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2006-09-07 12:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810192, 390351, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, the near pastel color tones are warm and wonderful.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice photo, the near pastel color tones are warm and wonderful.  Well done!', '2006-09-07 12:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810199, 391431, 42100, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photograph, the composition and light are outstanding.  Hope this is doing well, good luck!</td>', 'Fascinating photograph, the composition and light are outstanding.  Hope this is doing well, good luck!', '2006-09-07 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810211, 391679, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like the play of light on the subject and the great use of DOF in this photo.  I wish the subject was a bit more forceful to really take this very good photo to the next level.</td>', 'I like the play of light on the subject and the great use of DOF in this photo.  I wish the subject was a bit more forceful to really take this very good photo to the next level.', '2006-09-07 13:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810222, 391708, 52500, '<td valign="top">That horse has character.  He certainly looks like he is deep in thought.  Nice use of the rule to draw the eye down his long face to the most interesting (to me) part of the picture, his nose!</td>', 'That horse has character.  He certainly looks like he is deep in thought.  Nice use of the rule to draw the eye down his long face to the most interesting (to me) part of the picture, his nose!', '2006-09-07 13:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810228, 390628, 52500, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule, but I find the bird more interesting than the ferry.  I think a more dramatic sky would help this shot, but not much you could do about that, eh?</td>', 'Good use of the rule, but I find the bird more interesting than the ferry.  I think a more dramatic sky would help this shot, but not much you could do about that, eh?', '2006-09-07 13:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810239, 391437, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but the overall feel is a little dull to me.  I think I would prefer it with a bit more contrast and a bit sharper.</td>', 'Great capture, but the overall feel is a little dull to me.  I think I would prefer it with a bit more contrast and a bit sharper.', '2006-09-07 13:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810244, 391532, 64844, '<td valign="top">Is this the tutorial? :))<br/>Great idea!</td>', 'Is this the tutorial? :))Great idea!', '2006-09-07 13:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810248, 391774, 64844, '<td valign="top">Quite a composition!<br/>Fantastic!</td>', 'Quite a composition!Fantastic!', '2006-09-07 13:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810265, 391432, 54843, '<td valign="top">This would look great in B&amp;W!</td>', 'This would look great in B&W!', '2006-09-07 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810273, 391396, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice find and a beautiful photo.  The colors seem slightly muted to me, maybe a touch more contrast would help.  I think a little bit of USM would do wonders as well.  Overall, I like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice find and a beautiful photo.  The colors seem slightly muted to me, maybe a touch more contrast would help.  I think a little bit of USM would do wonders as well.  Overall, I like this a lot.', '2006-09-07 13:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810278, 390941, 55542, '<td valign="top">Very emotional shot. I love how the wall leads to the man, how the grey walls match the grey hair and the look on his face - perfect. 10</td>', 'Very emotional shot. I love how the wall leads to the man, how the grey walls match the grey hair and the look on his face - perfect. 10', '2006-09-07 13:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810283, 389586, 52500, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule.  Lovely colors and cool refraction.  I''d like to see it a little sharper, but overall a good concept and a good shot.</td>', 'Good use of the rule.  Lovely colors and cool refraction.  I''d like to see it a little sharper, but overall a good concept and a good shot.', '2006-09-07 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810285, 391511, 65080, '<td valign="top">interesting photo!<br/>I think there is a bit too much sky and the right branch is disturbing.</td>', 'interesting photo!I think there is a bit too much sky and the right branch is disturbing.', '2006-09-07 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810294, 391403, 54843, '<td valign="top">This is very striking, but I wish there were more facial features in focus...the eyes are the most important feature and should always have the sharpest focus.  I would try this again and ensure the eyes are in focus and then try and use a small aperature to get the pores into focus.  Perhaps you should use a longer lens to give you a larger DOF?  Great concept and great attempt.</td>', 'This is very striking, but I wish there were more facial features in focus...the eyes are the most important feature and should always have the sharpest focus.  I would try this again and ensure the eyes are in focus and then try and use a small aperature to get the pores into focus.  Perhaps you should use a longer lens to give you a larger DOF?  Great concept and great attempt.', '2006-09-07 13:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810295, 391260, 55542, '<td valign="top">What perfect focus. The angle of the dragonfly is very unusual. Excellent shot. 9</td>', 'What perfect focus. The angle of the dragonfly is very unusual. Excellent shot. 9', '2006-09-07 13:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810303, 390858, 54843, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a tighter crop.  Don''t worry about the bird...I would like to see more detail of the surf!  great picture none-the-less.</td>', 'I would like to see a tighter crop.  Don''t worry about the bird...I would like to see more detail of the surf!  great picture none-the-less.', '2006-09-07 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810306, 391501, 54843, '<td valign="top">striking.  thought this was digital art at first.</td>', 'striking.  thought this was digital art at first.', '2006-09-07 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810309, 390073, 52500, '<td valign="top">Good idea and interesting subject.  It''s almost abstract.  The only thing holding this back for me is the composition (well, and the size - I recommend always using the full 640 on a side).  I think it would be more dynamic and meet the challenge more strongly in a landscape crop with the clover shape centered on the top left thirds line intersection.</td>', 'Good idea and interesting subject.  It''s almost abstract.  The only thing holding this back for me is the composition (well, and the size - I recommend always using the full 640 on a side).  I think it would be more dynamic and meet the challenge more strongly in a landscape crop with the clover shape centered on the top left thirds line intersection.', '2006-09-07 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2810314, 390629, 65080, '<td valign="top">it was perfect for silhouette!</td>', 'it was perfect for silhouette!', '2006-09-07 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810316, 391625, 65080, '<td valign="top">I like it: nice subject, colors, lights, 1/3rd rule.<br/>Good job!</td>', 'I like it: nice subject, colors, lights, 1/3rd rule.Good job!', '2006-09-07 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810317, 391317, 65080, '<td valign="top">unbelievable sky!</td>', 'unbelievable sky!', '2006-09-07 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810318, 391774, 54843, '<td valign="top">Neat concept.  I would like to see it a little brighter (the apple that is).</td>', 'Neat concept.  I would like to see it a little brighter (the apple that is).', '2006-09-07 13:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810322, 390939, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nicely made natural triptych.  Interesting design, and the chick adds additional interest.  Well done.</td>', 'Nicely made natural triptych.  Interesting design, and the chick adds additional interest.  Well done.', '2006-09-07 13:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810331, 391240, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Very lovely soft fall colors.  The only thing I don''t like is the orange line border.  Gives it a Halloweeny feel.  (no deduction for the border, by the way).</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Very lovely soft fall colors.  The only thing I don''t like is the orange line border.  Gives it a Halloweeny feel.  (no deduction for the border, by the way).', '2006-09-07 13:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810333, 390445, 54843, '<td valign="top">The crop seems a little strange.  I think I would loosen up the crop to add the first eye.  That might move your smile off the 1/3 mark, but it might improve the image enough that people won''t care.  NOT SURE, just a suggestion.</td>', 'The crop seems a little strange.  I think I would loosen up the crop to add the first eye.  That might move your smile off the 1/3 mark, but it might improve the image enough that people won''t care.  NOT SURE, just a suggestion.', '2006-09-07 13:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810340, 389219, 52500, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool photo.  Nice motion capture of the wave.  For this challenge, I would like this better if the horizon and the large horizontal stone were closer to the thirds lines.</td>', 'Pretty cool photo.  Nice motion capture of the wave.  For this challenge, I would like this better if the horizon and the large horizontal stone were closer to the thirds lines.', '2006-09-07 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810345, 391789, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the darks with the bright green thing.  I think I would prefer a touch deeper DOF to get more of the green thing in focus.  Other than that, very cool looking!</td>', 'I like the contrast of the darks with the bright green thing.  I think I would prefer a touch deeper DOF to get more of the green thing in focus.  Other than that, very cool looking!', '2006-09-07 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810346, 391564, 54843, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  I can''t tell if there is motion blur in the foreground or if that is just the appearance of the cotton.  A faster shutter speed would obviously have solved the motion blur.<br/> <br/>Next, try adding more contrast to the sky to get the clouds to really stand out.  Also, add more saturation and contrast to get the grass and mountains to be more vivid.<br/> <br/>I think this is a great image and can be greatly improved with some of Bear_Music''s editing techniques.</td>', 'Nice landscape.  I can''t tell if there is motion blur in the foreground or if that is just the appearance of the cotton.  A faster shutter speed would obviously have solved the motion blur. Next, try adding more contrast to the sky to get the clouds to really stand out.  Also, add more saturation and contrast to get the grass and mountains to be more vivid. I think this is a great image and can be greatly improved with some of Bear_Music''s editing techniques.', '2006-09-07 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810357, 391532, 52500, '<td valign="top">Well, obviously meets the challenge!  Well done making this POTentially boring subject quite interesting.  I love the texture of the tiles and the diagonal lines of the shadows.</td>', 'Well, obviously meets the challenge!  Well done making this POTentially boring subject quite interesting.  I love the texture of the tiles and the diagonal lines of the shadows.', '2006-09-07 13:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810359, 390629, 54843, '<td valign="top">Technically, the subject is a little too far to the right - but I won''t hold it against you. :)  Nice concept.  I would like to see this again with a lower sun...the sunset colors could really break this image out and make it very appealing.</td>', 'Technically, the subject is a little too far to the right - but I won''t hold it against you. :)  Nice concept.  I would like to see this again with a lower sun...the sunset colors could really break this image out and make it very appealing.', '2006-09-07 13:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810368, 389606, 54843, '<td valign="top">nice candid.  Try cropping out the bottom a little more to get rid of the green leaf.</td>', 'nice candid.  Try cropping out the bottom a little more to get rid of the green leaf.', '2006-09-07 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810375, 390739, 54843, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the right (subject''s left) eye in focus...just because it is illuminated and the detail in the iris will show up.</td>', 'I would like to see the right (subject''s left) eye in focus...just because it is illuminated and the detail in the iris will show up.', '2006-09-07 13:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810377, 391290, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture.  Interesting scene, but the colors seem a little dull.  I would like to see this nicely saturated.</td>', 'Nice motion capture.  Interesting scene, but the colors seem a little dull.  I would like to see this nicely saturated.', '2006-09-07 13:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810408, 391239, 52500, '<td valign="top">Some nice fireworks, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  I think it would help if the main bursts were a little closer to the thirds lines.</td>', 'Some nice fireworks, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  I think it would help if the main bursts were a little closer to the thirds lines.', '2006-09-07 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810413, 391441, 52500, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but I''m sure it''s more interesting to the people in the picture than it is to me.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but I''m sure it''s more interesting to the people in the picture than it is to me.', '2006-09-07 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810420, 391569, 52500, '<td valign="top">...and a lovely garden statue it is, but there''s not much else to hold my interest here.</td>', '...and a lovely garden statue it is, but there''s not much else to hold my interest here.', '2006-09-07 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810424, 391432, 8300, '<td valign="top">very nice. they really stand out.</td>', 'very nice. they really stand out.', '2006-09-07 13:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810439, 391565, 52500, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait.  The windows in the background are slightly distracting, but only slightly (because you force my attention directly on her left eye!).</td>', 'A lovely portrait.  The windows in the background are slightly distracting, but only slightly (because you force my attention directly on her left eye!).', '2006-09-07 13:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810445, 391578, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool statue, and I like your processing.</td>', 'That''s a cool statue, and I like your processing.', '2006-09-07 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810451, 389654, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s a funky looking lighthouse!  Too bad you didn''t have some crazy dramatic clouds that day.  I like the one tall window.</td>', 'That''s a funky looking lighthouse!  Too bad you didn''t have some crazy dramatic clouds that day.  I like the one tall window.', '2006-09-07 13:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810455, 389517, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  He seems so relaxed and at ease with the world.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  He seems so relaxed and at ease with the world.', '2006-09-07 13:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810464, 391036, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great point of view and subject matter, but the lighting seems kinda harsh (lots of blown out water) and I''m not seeing how the rule of thirds helps you here.</td>', 'Great point of view and subject matter, but the lighting seems kinda harsh (lots of blown out water) and I''m not seeing how the rule of thirds helps you here.', '2006-09-07 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810468, 389949, 63639, '<td valign="top">I really like the sillouette of the plant, but it is almost centered in the frame, to fit the rule of thirds it should be closer to the intersection of the lines if the frame was divided into thirds both horizontally and vertically.<br/> <br/>edited<br/> I am sorry I guess it is at the intersection of the thirds, I was wrong for once ;) I guess I would have liked to see more in the foreground because of the limited depth of field.  I upgraded your score a little too.</td>', 'I really like the sillouette of the plant, but it is almost centered in the frame, to fit the rule of thirds it should be closer to the intersection of the lines if the frame was divided into thirds both horizontally and vertically. edited I am sorry I guess it is at the intersection of the thirds, I was wrong for once ;) I guess I would have liked to see more in the foreground because of the limited depth of field.  I upgraded your score a little too.', '2006-09-07 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810469, 389949, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I love it.  That glow is mesmerizing.  You found the perfect vantage point and time of day.</td>', 'Very cool, I love it.  That glow is mesmerizing.  You found the perfect vantage point and time of day.', '2006-09-07 13:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810487, 391089, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  It does seem oversharpened (or something, crazy haloing going on) though.</td>', 'Great capture.  It does seem oversharpened (or something, crazy haloing going on) though.', '2006-09-07 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810489, 391703, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating... what the hell is it?</td>', 'fascinating... what the hell is it?', '2006-09-07 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810496, 391672, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great idea to use the window/shelves.  I actually find the glass and the distorted scene behind it more interesting than the tea cups.</td>', 'Great idea to use the window/shelves.  I actually find the glass and the distorted scene behind it more interesting than the tea cups.', '2006-09-07 14:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810545, 391728, 46020, '<td valign="top">Well this is certianly one for the wall!  excellent example of Rule of thirds.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well this is certianly one for the wall!  excellent example of Rule of thirds.  Good luck.', '2006-09-07 14:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810548, 391154, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the bubbles and interesting refraction/reflections.  The overall noise/grain is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice color in the bubbles and interesting refraction/reflections.  The overall noise/grain is a bit distracting.', '2006-09-07 14:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810550, 390474, 52500, '<td valign="top">Vibrant is right!  Looks great.</td>', 'Vibrant is right!  Looks great.', '2006-09-07 14:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810553, 391556, 46020, '<td valign="top">Border is WAAY too big.</td>', 'Border is WAAY too big.', '2006-09-07 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810556, 390446, 52500, '<td valign="top">Cool, does it play MP3s?  Ha ha, I just crack myself up!  Anyway, awesome blue light, and great composition.</td>', 'Cool, does it play MP3s?  Ha ha, I just crack myself up!  Anyway, awesome blue light, and great composition.', '2006-09-07 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810558, 390727, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''m not usually a fan of selective desat, but it works quite well here.</td>', 'Very nice.  I''m not usually a fan of selective desat, but it works quite well here.', '2006-09-07 14:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810561, 390863, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter, but I think it''s oversharpened?  All of the edges look kinda tweaky.  Other than that, looks cool!  Nice color.</td>', 'Great subject matter, but I think it''s oversharpened?  All of the edges look kinda tweaky.  Other than that, looks cool!  Nice color.', '2006-09-07 14:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810563, 391118, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice land/seascape, but I don''t really see the rule of thirds coming into play here.</td>', 'Nice land/seascape, but I don''t really see the rule of thirds coming into play here.', '2006-09-07 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810567, 390585, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great sky.  Very nice composition.  The focus is obviously the fisherman, and I like the leading lines of the pier drawing us out to his destination.</td>', 'Great sky.  Very nice composition.  The focus is obviously the fisherman, and I like the leading lines of the pier drawing us out to his destination.', '2006-09-07 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810574, 390849, 52500, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool place for a walk.  The focus seems a bit off/soft, though.</td>', 'Looks like a cool place for a walk.  The focus seems a bit off/soft, though.', '2006-09-07 14:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810578, 391074, 52500, '<td valign="top">The old items themselves are mildly interesting, but their setting is rather blah.  Also, the point of focus appears to be just outside the picture to the right.</td>', 'The old items themselves are mildly interesting, but their setting is rather blah.  Also, the point of focus appears to be just outside the picture to the right.', '2006-09-07 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810583, 389940, 52500, '<td valign="top">A decent landscape, and my eye is indeed drawn to the water in the foreground.</td>', 'A decent landscape, and my eye is indeed drawn to the water in the foreground.', '2006-09-07 14:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810589, 391187, 52500, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the border.  I think a simple white would work much better.  Oh, yeah, the photo...nice sharpness and contrast between the green and the reds.</td>', 'Not a fan of the border.  I think a simple white would work much better.  Oh, yeah, the photo...nice sharpness and contrast between the green and the reds.', '2006-09-07 14:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810600, 391183, 52500, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see anything more in this than a nice picture of a cool piece of art.  The photo itself doesn''t really come across as the art.  I also recommend using the full 640 on a side.</td>', 'I don''t really see anything more in this than a nice picture of a cool piece of art.  The photo itself doesn''t really come across as the art.  I also recommend using the full 640 on a side.', '2006-09-07 14:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810606, 388219, 52500, '<td valign="top">Damn, that red is bright!  I think it''s a bit too bright.  It competes with your subject.  Other than that, this is cool.  Nice use of thirds and a cool looking little beastie.</td>', 'Damn, that red is bright!  I think it''s a bit too bright.  It competes with your subject.  Other than that, this is cool.  Nice use of thirds and a cool looking little beastie.', '2006-09-07 14:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810617, 389529, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant color.  I think it would be more dramatic with just one flower, but this is still cool!</td>', 'Nice vibrant color.  I think it would be more dramatic with just one flower, but this is still cool!', '2006-09-07 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810626, 389606, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a shot in progress.  I think the background is a little too busy and blah, thus rather distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot of a shot in progress.  I think the background is a little too busy and blah, thus rather distracting.', '2006-09-07 14:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810633, 389921, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very cool frog.  If only he wasn''t centered!</td>', 'Very cool frog.  If only he wasn''t centered!', '2006-09-07 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810639, 391181, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good composition, but I would like to see more detail in the duck (closer crop, sharper focus maybe?).</td>', 'Nice idea and good composition, but I would like to see more detail in the duck (closer crop, sharper focus maybe?).', '2006-09-07 14:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810649, 391645, 52500, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title (not that that really matters).  That''s a cool bird and I like the white on green.  I think a shallower DOF to blur the background might make the bird pop out a little more.</td>', 'I don''t get the title (not that that really matters).  That''s a cool bird and I like the white on green.  I think a shallower DOF to blur the background might make the bird pop out a little more.', '2006-09-07 14:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810659, 391451, 52500, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well executed.  I''d like to see this processed to look more dark and dismal to go with the theme and the expression on her face.</td>', 'Good idea and well executed.  I''d like to see this processed to look more dark and dismal to go with the theme and the expression on her face.', '2006-09-07 14:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2810677, 390760, 63163, '<td valign="top">To out of focus for me.  Looks to be a buckskin, he blends in with the footing &amp; grass along the fence.  I think if the hue/saturation was adjusted it would bring out his black legs, brighten the background and define his coat.</td>', 'To out of focus for me.  Looks to be a buckskin, he blends in with the footing & grass along the fence.  I think if the hue/saturation was adjusted it would bring out his black legs, brighten the background and define his coat.', '2006-09-07 14:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
