(2811972, 391117, 62671, '<td valign="top">If a fly can show expression, this one does!  This is incredible shot.  Love the background too.  His red eyes really stand out.</td>', 'If a fly can show expression, this one does!  This is incredible shot.  Love the background too.  His red eyes really stand out.', '2006-09-07 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811974, 391589, 55542, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite put my finger on it, but I really like this shot...the expression on the model''s face and the "fuzziness" seem to go very well together. Very artistic.</td>', 'I can''t quite put my finger on it, but I really like this shot...the expression on the model''s face and the "fuzziness" seem to go very well together. Very artistic.', '2006-09-07 20:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811986, 390866, 62671, '<td valign="top">The materials and textures here are nice.   The lines give an abstract sort of feel for me, but I don''t see a subject that is in the 1/3rd position to meet this challenge criteria.  I like the curve of the banister but its showing noise in the darker regions.</td>', 'The materials and textures here are nice.   The lines give an abstract sort of feel for me, but I don''t see a subject that is in the 1/3rd position to meet this challenge criteria.  I like the curve of the banister but its showing noise in the darker regions.', '2006-09-07 20:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2811995, 391718, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love how her purple just pops on this shot.   The golashes match the raincoat too!  Excellent.  The dark and gloomy feel of the surroundings match the subject perfectly.  Great focus and dof.</td>', 'I love how her purple just pops on this shot.   The golashes match the raincoat too!  Excellent.  The dark and gloomy feel of the surroundings match the subject perfectly.  Great focus and dof.', '2006-09-07 20:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812004, 391166, 6179, '<td valign="top">Just a tad blurry for me. Use a higher ISO next time to pump up your shutter speed. It looked a little overcast.</td>', 'Just a tad blurry for me. Use a higher ISO next time to pump up your shutter speed. It looked a little overcast.', '2006-09-07 20:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812010, 391626, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of this challenge - and not because I live here either.  The focus and shutter speed are both well done.  Nice interest and the colours are good too.  9.</td>', 'One of my favourites of this challenge - and not because I live here either.  The focus and shutter speed are both well done.  Nice interest and the colours are good too.  9.', '2006-09-07 20:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812014, 391515, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice detail but it almost looks too oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice detail but it almost looks too oversharpened.', '2006-09-07 20:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812124, 391241, 62671, '<td valign="top">There are spots on the flower that is in the 1/3rd position.  However, you have all three competing for the subject.  If you intended the grouping to be the subject it is centrally located and not fitting this criteria. Which is how I am reading it.  There are two ways that I can think of at this moment to correct that.  use a very shallow dof and have the larger flower in focus and the other two blurred out.  Since they are further from the camera, it should be possible.  The other way is to move the angle of the camera.  Instead of top down,  go from the side about 45 degrees from the horizontal plane so you can see the center of the flower.  Use a shallow dof to show depth.  Looks like the lighting is good for this subject.</td>', 'There are spots on the flower that is in the 1/3rd position.  However, you have all three competing for the subject.  If you intended the grouping to be the subject it is centrally located and not fitting this criteria. Which is how I am reading it.  There are two ways that I can think of at this moment to correct that.  use a very shallow dof and have the larger flower in focus and the other two blurred out.  Since they are further from the camera, it should be possible.  The other way is to move the angle of the camera.  Instead of top down,  go from the side about 45 degrees from the horizontal plane so you can see the center of the flower.  Use a shallow dof to show depth.  Looks like the lighting is good for this subject.', '2006-09-07 21:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812164, 389137, 62671, '<td valign="top">very scholarly,  I love the b&amp;w on this image.  The books an awsome background for this image.</td>', 'very scholarly,  I love the b&w on this image.  The books an awsome background for this image.', '2006-09-07 21:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812212, 389137, 53243, '<td valign="top">the top is too dark for me, but I like the idea.</td>', 'the top is too dark for me, but I like the idea.', '2006-09-07 21:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812219, 391511, 53243, '<td valign="top">more of the sky could have been cropped to give more emphasis to the rocks</td>', 'more of the sky could have been cropped to give more emphasis to the rocks', '2006-09-07 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812232, 389885, 57202, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF, sharp focus on the acorns, and excellent composition. :)  The duotones used couldn''t fit the photo better.  The border also works perfectly for this shot. 10 from me. :D</td>', 'Perfect DOF, sharp focus on the acorns, and excellent composition. :)  The duotones used couldn''t fit the photo better.  The border also works perfectly for this shot. 10 from me. :D', '2006-09-07 21:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812298, 391392, 33352, '<td valign="top">Magic challenge entry, top shelf</td>', 'Magic challenge entry, top shelf', '2006-09-07 21:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812330, 390506, 33352, '<td valign="top">Awesome image for this challenge,with the hand and eyes both in 1/3 rule, great mood feeling, love the texture....top shelf</td>', 'Awesome image for this challenge,with the hand and eyes both in 1/3 rule, great mood feeling, love the texture....top shelf', '2006-09-07 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812352, 390585, 62671, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more color on this.   I love the one point  perspective.   You have red on the fellas cart in the front and the person further down the pier has red pants, its confusing on which is the subject. <br/>If it is the guy closest to the camera, he is on the 1/3rd plane vertically but not horizontally.    If it is the two at the further end of the pier,  they are in the right position.  But they are so small on the image that makes you think its the guy with the cart.   The leading lines of the pier bring you back to the two at the end.   I think you get the idea.   Eenie meenie miney mo...</td>', 'I would have liked to see more color on this.   I love the one point  perspective.   You have red on the fellas cart in the front and the person further down the pier has red pants, its confusing on which is the subject. If it is the guy closest to the camera, he is on the 1/3rd plane vertically but not horizontally.    If it is the two at the further end of the pier,  they are in the right position.  But they are so small on the image that makes you think its the guy with the cart.   The leading lines of the pier bring you back to the two at the end.   I think you get the idea.   Eenie meenie miney mo...', '2006-09-07 21:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812405, 391578, 62671, '<td valign="top">This is nice,  I like the sepia but a little grain might have helped the ''antique'' feel.   I really love the farmhouse in the distance.  The clouds are acting as leading lines bringing your eye into the statue.  <br/>The horizon is a tad crooked.</td>', 'This is nice,  I like the sepia but a little grain might have helped the ''antique'' feel.   I really love the farmhouse in the distance.  The clouds are acting as leading lines bringing your eye into the statue.  The horizon is a tad crooked.', '2006-09-07 22:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812439, 391080, 62671, '<td valign="top">That looks like an image taken by Lee Frost.    I would have liked it if the eye was clear and not clouded over.   I like the texture of the scales.   I dont like the white thing that seems to be hainging from his underside.</td>', 'That looks like an image taken by Lee Frost.    I would have liked it if the eye was clear and not clouded over.   I like the texture of the scales.   I dont like the white thing that seems to be hainging from his underside.', '2006-09-07 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812449, 391607, 62671, '<td valign="top">That sky is really nice.  The bird is not in the intersection of the 1/3rd plane.  I would also like it if he was looking toward the camera.  Or  you could have b&amp;w it to give it more of the creepy feeling the subject inspires.</td>', 'That sky is really nice.  The bird is not in the intersection of the 1/3rd plane.  I would also like it if he was looking toward the camera.  Or  you could have b&w it to give it more of the creepy feeling the subject inspires.', '2006-09-07 22:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812468, 391708, 62671, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  The head is on the 1/3rd vertical plane.  The eyes intersect the horizontal plane.  The fence leads you to the eyes.  Perfect lighting and dof.  AND not a horsefly in sight!   I so want to pet that soft nose!</td>', 'Excellent!  The head is on the 1/3rd vertical plane.  The eyes intersect the horizontal plane.  The fence leads you to the eyes.  Perfect lighting and dof.  AND not a horsefly in sight!   I so want to pet that soft nose!', '2006-09-07 22:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812485, 390983, 38234, '<td valign="top">LOL - thanks for the smile:-)  what a face!!!</td>', 'LOL - thanks for the smile:-)  what a face!!!', '2006-09-07 22:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812490, 391389, 62671, '<td valign="top">The colorizing here is cool!  My favorite color!   The bird flying by is an interesting touch.   Good comp.</td>', 'The colorizing here is cool!  My favorite color!   The bird flying by is an interesting touch.   Good comp.', '2006-09-07 22:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812508, 390965, 57202, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I wonder if this could be the work of the great Larus... :)  The composition is perfect as usual and the woman is very well lit.  I only have a couple small qualms with this shot.  It''s tough to get around the unpredictable nature of weather, but I wish there were more colors in the sky.  Also, the reeds that appear to be in the lower-left portion of the frame are a little distracting.  Still an awesome shot though.  I love how her positioning and her reflection fill in different thirds of the shot. :D  Excellent overall shot - 9 from me.</td>', 'Hmmm, I wonder if this could be the work of the great Larus... :)  The composition is perfect as usual and the woman is very well lit.  I only have a couple small qualms with this shot.  It''s tough to get around the unpredictable nature of weather, but I wish there were more colors in the sky.  Also, the reeds that appear to be in the lower-left portion of the frame are a little distracting.  Still an awesome shot though.  I love how her positioning and her reflection fill in different thirds of the shot. :D  Excellent overall shot - 9 from me.', '2006-09-07 22:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812546, 391421, 61138, '<td valign="top">Like the natural expression, the un-posed feel.</td>', 'Like the natural expression, the un-posed feel.', '2006-09-07 22:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812705, 391591, 62671, '<td valign="top">The placement is a little off.  The moon is big and bright with good detail.  The sky is bland in tone.  Tried to take a shot tonight of the hunters moon.  I didn''t have any luck getting the color right.</td>', 'The placement is a little off.  The moon is big and bright with good detail.  The sky is bland in tone.  Tried to take a shot tonight of the hunters moon.  I didn''t have any luck getting the color right.', '2006-09-07 22:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812713, 391501, 62671, '<td valign="top">shouldn''t that light be yellow?  lol This is really cool.</td>', 'shouldn''t that light be yellow?  lol This is really cool.', '2006-09-07 22:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812757, 388625, 62671, '<td valign="top">I tend to avoid the bottom 1/3rd horizontal line when the sky has no texture.  However, I understand the lightpost dictated that this time around.  This is something not quite right here and I''m not sure what it is.  It might be the angle of the light.  I would remove the bright white spot in the middle of the water.   This would make a great panoramic if you cropped off the top.</td>', 'I tend to avoid the bottom 1/3rd horizontal line when the sky has no texture.  However, I understand the lightpost dictated that this time around.  This is something not quite right here and I''m not sure what it is.  It might be the angle of the light.  I would remove the bright white spot in the middle of the water.   This would make a great panoramic if you cropped off the top.', '2006-09-07 23:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812777, 391284, 62671, '<td valign="top">The rose is pretty but not in the right position.  The moon is without detail to be the subject but its in the right spot. Although a beautiful rose, I don''t think it works for this challenge.</td>', 'The rose is pretty but not in the right position.  The moon is without detail to be the subject but its in the right spot. Although a beautiful rose, I don''t think it works for this challenge.', '2006-09-07 23:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812800, 391477, 62671, '<td valign="top">OMG this is waaaay cool!  I wish it was clear all the way around!  The blurred out petal is a bit distracting.  This image is so different than the usual flower shot!</td>', 'OMG this is waaaay cool!  I wish it was clear all the way around!  The blurred out petal is a bit distracting.  This image is so different than the usual flower shot!', '2006-09-07 23:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812823, 388992, 62671, '<td valign="top">I really do see a dragon here!  Thats so different!  The face is on the vertical 1/3rd position but it is not on the horizontal one.  good lighting and dof.  Great imagination!</td>', 'I really do see a dragon here!  Thats so different!  The face is on the vertical 1/3rd position but it is not on the horizontal one.  good lighting and dof.  Great imagination!', '2006-09-07 23:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812859, 391696, 41800, '<td valign="top">nice clear shot. interesting subject but the contrast is a little blown out leaving a large white patch on her shoulder and white on nose and cheeks.I really don''t care for the background and find it distracting and kind of evil looking. a different background would have totally changed it for the better.</td>', 'nice clear shot. interesting subject but the contrast is a little blown out leaving a large white patch on her shoulder and white on nose and cheeks.I really don''t care for the background and find it distracting and kind of evil looking. a different background would have totally changed it for the better.', '2006-09-07 23:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2812889, 390311, 62671, '<td valign="top">The sky is over exposed and the rest needs some contrast.   Composition is good though.  With a bit of post processing this could be great!</td>', 'The sky is over exposed and the rest needs some contrast.   Composition is good though.  With a bit of post processing this could be great!', '2006-09-07 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
