(2814043, 388207, 51653, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid, but this shot does not really seem com posed according to the rule of the thirds.</td>', 'I''m afraid, but this shot does not really seem com posed according to the rule of the thirds.', '2006-09-08 05:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2814072, 390395, 51653, '<td valign="top">The shot is framed according to the rule of thirds, but despite the title, the real subject (or at least what I perceive as the subject) is really well centered. So I''m wondering if it meets the challenge. I''m assuming it does.<br/> <br/>However I do not like this shot very much. The main problem I have with it is that I cannot find something really interesting to hold on and the only things to attract my attention are the dirt spots on the window. Not very pleasant.</td>', 'The shot is framed according to the rule of thirds, but despite the title, the real subject (or at least what I perceive as the subject) is really well centered. So I''m wondering if it meets the challenge. I''m assuming it does. However I do not like this shot very much. The main problem I have with it is that I cannot find something really interesting to hold on and the only things to attract my attention are the dirt spots on the window. Not very pleasant.', '2006-09-08 05:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2814075, 390142, 51653, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the barbed wire and the spider net, but I find the backgraound bothering. I think with a better bokeh it would be really appealing</td>', 'I like the contrast between the barbed wire and the spider net, but I find the backgraound bothering. I think with a better bokeh it would be really appealing', '2006-09-08 05:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
