(2815054, 391672, 64844, '<td valign="top">ha ha - I don''t know if this was really the meaning the challenge, but it''s a nice idea! Literally thirds for any coffee or tea lover...</td>', 'ha ha - I don''t know if this was really the meaning the challenge, but it''s a nice idea! Literally thirds for any coffee or tea lover...', '2006-09-08 12:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815068, 390997, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and to bump to an 8.  Wonderful job of highlighting a subject so well camouflaged.</td>', 'Back to comment and to bump to an 8.  Wonderful job of highlighting a subject so well camouflaged.', '2006-09-08 12:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815072, 391312, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  I know that this type of image doesn''t always score well at DPC but I love the mood and motion you captured here.  Adding this to my favorites and bumping to an 8.</td>', 'Back to comment:  I know that this type of image doesn''t always score well at DPC but I love the mood and motion you captured here.  Adding this to my favorites and bumping to an 8.', '2006-09-08 12:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815075, 391515, 64844, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of the moon! I can only dream of such a shot!<br/> However, as there is literally nothing else, I think it wouldn''t matter where it is placed - well, I wouldn''t have chosen it for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a great shot of the moon! I can only dream of such a shot! However, as there is literally nothing else, I think it wouldn''t matter where it is placed - well, I wouldn''t have chosen it for this challenge.', '2006-09-08 12:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815079, 391150, 61679, '<td valign="top">Your image appears to be out of focus and could use some post processing work to boost the colors and contrast.</td>', 'Your image appears to be out of focus and could use some post processing work to boost the colors and contrast.', '2006-09-08 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815084, 389921, 61679, '<td valign="top">I think you missed the concept on the rule of thirds, as your main subject is centered in the image.</td>', 'I think you missed the concept on the rule of thirds, as your main subject is centered in the image.', '2006-09-08 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815088, 390599, 64844, '<td valign="top">great use of the (well almost) complementary colors!</td>', 'great use of the (well almost) complementary colors!', '2006-09-08 12:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815089, 388207, 61679, '<td valign="top">The pillars in the foreground meet the rule of thirds discription but the picture looks out of focus and grainy.</td>', 'The pillars in the foreground meet the rule of thirds discription but the picture looks out of focus and grainy.', '2006-09-08 12:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815092, 391166, 61679, '<td valign="top">I think your score would be higher if the main subject of the photo were in focus instead of the leaf in the background.</td>', 'I think your score would be higher if the main subject of the photo were in focus instead of the leaf in the background.', '2006-09-08 12:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815093, 391239, 64844, '<td valign="top">where is the mouth? :))</td>', 'where is the mouth? :))', '2006-09-08 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815094, 391805, 64844, '<td valign="top">great bokeh!</td>', 'great bokeh!', '2006-09-08 12:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815102, 391621, 61679, '<td valign="top">To me the main subject of this image is the farm buildings, which happen to be closer to the center of the image than the standard rule of third locations.  The colors are also a bit over satureated for my taste.</td>', 'To me the main subject of this image is the farm buildings, which happen to be closer to the center of the image than the standard rule of third locations.  The colors are also a bit over satureated for my taste.', '2006-09-08 12:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815125, 391578, 61679, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job of placing the statue according to the challenge description; however, the subject choosen has little appeal emotionally or visually.  Plus, I''m not sure if converting this to sepia really works for this image, as it tends to make the statue blend into the background in spite of the good contrast on the statue itself.</td>', 'You did a nice job of placing the statue according to the challenge description; however, the subject choosen has little appeal emotionally or visually.  Plus, I''m not sure if converting this to sepia really works for this image, as it tends to make the statue blend into the background in spite of the good contrast on the statue itself.', '2006-09-08 12:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815146, 391187, 33105, '<td valign="top">Hate the border love the image</td>', 'Hate the border love the image', '2006-09-08 13:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815151, 391696, 61679, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job of placing the girl according to the rule of thirds; however, in doing so you created a bunch of negative space behind her that fails to add to the image and even distracts from the main subject.  I think you could have cropped out that doll/object in the background and still met the challenge intent with the girl''s eyes fulfilling the rule of thirds requirement.</td>', 'You did a nice job of placing the girl according to the rule of thirds; however, in doing so you created a bunch of negative space behind her that fails to add to the image and even distracts from the main subject.  I think you could have cropped out that doll/object in the background and still met the challenge intent with the girl''s eyes fulfilling the rule of thirds requirement.', '2006-09-08 13:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815157, 390444, 60581, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!!!!!</td>', 'beautiful!!!!!!', '2006-09-08 13:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815162, 390970, 60581, '<td valign="top">this is cool!!!!</td>', 'this is cool!!!!', '2006-09-08 13:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815166, 391665, 60581, '<td valign="top">I feel that this photograph is a bit flat, need some hue/saturation.</td>', 'I feel that this photograph is a bit flat, need some hue/saturation.', '2006-09-08 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815237, 391441, 24860, '<td valign="top">As cool as the stopped water is, I think this picture may have looked a little better with a slower shutter speed. Faster isn''t always better. 5</td>', 'As cool as the stopped water is, I think this picture may have looked a little better with a slower shutter speed. Faster isn''t always better. 5', '2006-09-08 13:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815249, 391118, 24860, '<td valign="top">Is this supposed to be a horizontal ROT? Too much empty space.</td>', 'Is this supposed to be a horizontal ROT? Too much empty space.', '2006-09-08 13:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815254, 391515, 24860, '<td valign="top">Umm, WOW! Finally got some use out of the old 1500mm lens, eh? That''s a really great shot. 7</td>', 'Umm, WOW! Finally got some use out of the old 1500mm lens, eh? That''s a really great shot. 7', '2006-09-08 13:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815268, 389885, 33105, '<td valign="top">Hate the border love the image</td>', 'Hate the border love the image', '2006-09-08 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815269, 390679, 24860, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too abstract. :) I understand what you are going for, interesting idea.</td>', 'Maybe a little too abstract. :) I understand what you are going for, interesting idea.', '2006-09-08 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815274, 389200, 24860, '<td valign="top">Too much ISO? Not enough image quality.</td>', 'Too much ISO? Not enough image quality.', '2006-09-08 13:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815285, 391118, 55005, '<td valign="top">I feel like less sky would have given this photo much more depth. I do like the blues a lot but the dry tree in the middle captures my attention too much.  A different crop might have made this, in my opinion, a stronger photo.</td>', 'I feel like less sky would have given this photo much more depth. I do like the blues a lot but the dry tree in the middle captures my attention too much.  A different crop might have made this, in my opinion, a stronger photo.', '2006-09-08 13:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815286, 391425, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love the richness of the green.  The water drop seems a bit too bright, in my opinion.  I do like a lot the shadow that it is casting on the leaf.</td>', 'I love the richness of the green.  The water drop seems a bit too bright, in my opinion.  I do like a lot the shadow that it is casting on the leaf.', '2006-09-08 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
