(2815293, 391745, 55005, '<td valign="top">I really like that this photo is in BW -- I don''t know if it could be that good in color.  I really like the gradient in the clouds.  It would have been better without the trash can but I am sure there was little you could do about that.  :)  Great job!</td>', 'I really like that this photo is in BW -- I don''t know if it could be that good in color.  I really like the gradient in the clouds.  It would have been better without the trash can but I am sure there was little you could do about that.  :)  Great job!', '2006-09-08 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815296, 391716, 55005, '<td valign="top">I would have like dot see this photo a bit sharper -- the focus feels a bit soft.  The shiny trash (not sure what it is but I can see plastic bottles) is fairly distracting.</td>', 'I would have like dot see this photo a bit sharper -- the focus feels a bit soft.  The shiny trash (not sure what it is but I can see plastic bottles) is fairly distracting.', '2006-09-08 13:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815298, 391013, 55005, '<td valign="top">The colors look a bit off and I wish the sky was more photogenic.  I feel that the plant is too busy to begin with, maybe a tighter crop or isolating one leaf would have made a stronger image.</td>', 'The colors look a bit off and I wish the sky was more photogenic.  I feel that the plant is too busy to begin with, maybe a tighter crop or isolating one leaf would have made a stronger image.', '2006-09-08 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
