(2815612, 390760, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think with the white sky, this is screaming for a black and white conversion.  Or maybe sepia. Nice stop action. I like how the fence lines pull you right back to the horse.</td>', 'I think with the white sky, this is screaming for a black and white conversion.  Or maybe sepia. Nice stop action. I like how the fence lines pull you right back to the horse.', '2006-09-08 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815613, 391735, 55005, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see the bee in focus, rather than the plant.  I would have also liked to see a blurrier background so that the eyes are drawn to the flower and the bee (maybe a tighter crop would have made this photo stronger). I do like the colors and how yellow stands out.</td>', 'I would have like to see the bee in focus, rather than the plant.  I would have also liked to see a blurrier background so that the eyes are drawn to the flower and the bee (maybe a tighter crop would have made this photo stronger). I do like the colors and how yellow stands out.', '2006-09-08 15:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815614, 390444, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!!!!  What a terrific candid type portrait.  Her eyes and face - the focus is perfect. Love those wisps of our, slightly out of focus.  Technically, pretty close to perfect for me. 9</td>', 'Oh my!!!!!  What a terrific candid type portrait.  Her eyes and face - the focus is perfect. Love those wisps of our, slightly out of focus.  Technically, pretty close to perfect for me. 9', '2006-09-08 15:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815616, 391451, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is GREAT!! I like the slightly humorous approach you took.</td>', 'Oh this is GREAT!! I like the slightly humorous approach you took.', '2006-09-08 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815652, 391432, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting.  The eye is drawn directly to the lady in white.  However, the smiling lady on the left is a bit of a distraction as she draws attention away from the main subject.  The lady in red is a perfect contrast to the couple in the spotlight due to the placement within the composition. 9</td>', 'Good composition and lighting.  The eye is drawn directly to the lady in white.  However, the smiling lady on the left is a bit of a distraction as she draws attention away from the main subject.  The lady in red is a perfect contrast to the couple in the spotlight due to the placement within the composition. 9', '2006-09-08 16:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815655, 391417, 7743, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh in this one though the main subject gets kind of lost in it. 7</td>', 'Love the bokeh in this one though the main subject gets kind of lost in it. 7', '2006-09-08 16:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815661, 389711, 5792, '<td valign="top">Bright sunlight illuminating the sidelined football player is a good visual highlight selection. Makes the viewer wonder what the football player is thinking and feeling as he watches the game. Good capture of action for the background. Good lighting, no overexposed areas and good sharpness. <br/> <br/>Centering the helmet on the lower left rule of thirds intersection point works for the challenge topic but not necessarily for the image itself. For this image, since the football player is the main subject, it might be better to center the whole player on the left vertical rule of thirds line rather than just the helmet at the intersection point. The far sideline acts a horizon. You might consider leveling that to true horizontal.</td>', 'Bright sunlight illuminating the sidelined football player is a good visual highlight selection. Makes the viewer wonder what the football player is thinking and feeling as he watches the game. Good capture of action for the background. Good lighting, no overexposed areas and good sharpness.  Centering the helmet on the lower left rule of thirds intersection point works for the challenge topic but not necessarily for the image itself. For this image, since the football player is the main subject, it might be better to center the whole player on the left vertical rule of thirds line rather than just the helmet at the intersection point. The far sideline acts a horizon. You might consider leveling that to true horizontal.', '2006-09-08 16:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815675, 391718, 62099, '<td valign="top">I love how the lines from the shoreline lead your eyes to the little girl</td>', 'I love how the lines from the shoreline lead your eyes to the little girl', '2006-09-08 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815679, 391667, 62099, '<td valign="top">Image is a little noisy</td>', 'Image is a little noisy', '2006-09-08 16:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815683, 391659, 62099, '<td valign="top">Love the colors! Vibrant yet soft</td>', 'Love the colors! Vibrant yet soft', '2006-09-08 16:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815708, 389097, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the cloud bank below the sun and the sihlouette of the foreground hill on the right makes for a very nice landscape. Horizon looks level.<br/> <br/>I see that you have the top of the cloud bank positined on the lower horizontal rule of thirds line. You might consider a different crop to meet this challenge. Consider a crop centering the sun exactly at the upper right rule of thirds intersection point. This not only better meets the specific challenge description but expands the screen real estate devoted to the most interesting areas of the image, the right side foregound and clouds. It cuts out less interesting sky and darker detail on the left and top of the image. Try it and you will probably like the result.</td>', 'Like the cloud bank below the sun and the sihlouette of the foreground hill on the right makes for a very nice landscape. Horizon looks level. I see that you have the top of the cloud bank positined on the lower horizontal rule of thirds line. You might consider a different crop to meet this challenge. Consider a crop centering the sun exactly at the upper right rule of thirds intersection point. This not only better meets the specific challenge description but expands the screen real estate devoted to the most interesting areas of the image, the right side foregound and clouds. It cuts out less interesting sky and darker detail on the left and top of the image. Try it and you will probably like the result.', '2006-09-08 16:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815712, 390866, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice framing but the soft focus of the railing hurts this image.</td>', 'Nice framing but the soft focus of the railing hurts this image.', '2006-09-08 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815713, 391661, 62099, '<td valign="top">I think this image has a lot of potential! It looks slightly out of focus, a little bit on the blue side, and needs just a little bit more contrast.</td>', 'I think this image has a lot of potential! It looks slightly out of focus, a little bit on the blue side, and needs just a little bit more contrast.', '2006-09-08 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815718, 391147, 62099, '<td valign="top">I like how the lines of the stair case leads you to the skateboarder.</td>', 'I like how the lines of the stair case leads you to the skateboarder.', '2006-09-08 16:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815736, 391532, 46832, '<td valign="top">It''s actually pretty good.</td>', 'It''s actually pretty good.', '2006-09-08 16:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2815743, 390068, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifull captured image. Nice frontal view perspective. Captured at the right moment and, unlike so many people, you got the horizon level. :)<br/> <br/>Slightly off from the left vertical rule of thirds line. Your main subject (windsurfer on board) should be centered slightly further to the right. Slightly oversharpened on the sail. A few of the sail bracings have the "jaggies".</td>', 'Beautifull captured image. Nice frontal view perspective. Captured at the right moment and, unlike so many people, you got the horizon level. :) Slightly off from the left vertical rule of thirds line. Your main subject (windsurfer on board) should be centered slightly further to the right. Slightly oversharpened on the sail. A few of the sail bracings have the "jaggies".', '2006-09-08 16:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
