(2816386, 390893, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Perfect use of the thirds and the negative space.  It''s too bad Le Mont isn''t a little brighter.  Maybe you could dodge it a bit for the print!</td>', 'Very cool.  Perfect use of the thirds and the negative space.  It''s too bad Le Mont isn''t a little brighter.  Maybe you could dodge it a bit for the print!', '2006-09-08 21:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
