(2816391, 390143, 52500, '<td valign="top">Don''t go in there!  This is very cool.  You found the perfect time of day to get a really cool light/shadow effect.</td>', 'Don''t go in there!  This is very cool.  You found the perfect time of day to get a really cool light/shadow effect.', '2006-09-08 21:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816392, 391625, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I love the sharpness and the softness.  Amazing light as well.  If you wanted to, you could probably get away with trimming some of the black off of the bottom.</td>', 'Fantastic.  I love the sharpness and the softness.  Amazing light as well.  If you wanted to, you could probably get away with trimming some of the black off of the bottom.', '2006-09-08 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816393, 391477, 52500, '<td valign="top">My instant reaction was "Wow, cool!".  I really like the shallow DOF, the color, and the way the droplets glisten in the light.  Meets the rule of thirds perfectly.  My only suggestion would be to add a little bit more negative space to the top and bottom.  It just feels that that flower needs a little more space to hang out in.</td>', 'My instant reaction was "Wow, cool!".  I really like the shallow DOF, the color, and the way the droplets glisten in the light.  Meets the rule of thirds perfectly.  My only suggestion would be to add a little bit more negative space to the top and bottom.  It just feels that that flower needs a little more space to hang out in.', '2006-09-08 21:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816395, 391659, 52500, '<td valign="top">SO gay a flower bereaved the mind  <br/>As if it were a woe,  <br/>Is Beauty an affliction, then?  <br/>Tradition ought to know. <br/> <br/>Awesome pic, beautiful poem.</td>', 'SO gay a flower bereaved the mind  As if it were a woe,  Is Beauty an affliction, then?  Tradition ought to know.  Awesome pic, beautiful poem.', '2006-09-08 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
