(2816620, 390395, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice tryptic!  Nice Thirds!  Nice!  :)<br/>   Of course, I couldn''t help noticing that the tower attracts the eye &amp; the window serves as framing enhancements to the tower.  I am sure many will notice and it could pull down your score.  At any rate much success to you!  :)</td>', 'Nice tryptic!  Nice Thirds!  Nice!  :)   Of course, I couldn''t help noticing that the tower attracts the eye & the window serves as framing enhancements to the tower.  I am sure many will notice and it could pull down your score.  At any rate much success to you!  :)', '2006-09-08 23:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
