(2816790, 391032, 62187, '<td valign="top">The Queen of Hearts is always your best friend but hey, you got one hot photo goin'' on here...right on the money! 10</td>', 'The Queen of Hearts is always your best friend but hey, you got one hot photo goin'' on here...right on the money! 10', '2006-09-09 01:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816791, 391802, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not to hot on the edti but that''s one weird sunray! Nice observation...</td>', 'Not to hot on the edti but that''s one weird sunray! Nice observation...', '2006-09-09 01:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816793, 388304, 62187, '<td valign="top">S.O.S. - I''m all wet...it took me a second to see all the thrids...great! My brother is in the Coast Guard. I''ll give it a 10.</td>', 'S.O.S. - I''m all wet...it took me a second to see all the thrids...great! My brother is in the Coast Guard. I''ll give it a 10.', '2006-09-09 01:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816799, 390965, 62187, '<td valign="top">You know, I''m kinda new to photography...this rule of thirds thing...to me, it seems like the subject is not quite what I understand the rule to be...but...with the reflection...it brings the subject to center of a third. I''m not sure if that''s what the challenge was. But, it''s a great photo - focus, color and lighting. I''m sure you''ll get bonus points for the model (!). I''ll give it an 8 because I think could be tilted to the right ever so slightly.</td>', 'You know, I''m kinda new to photography...this rule of thirds thing...to me, it seems like the subject is not quite what I understand the rule to be...but...with the reflection...it brings the subject to center of a third. I''m not sure if that''s what the challenge was. But, it''s a great photo - focus, color and lighting. I''m sure you''ll get bonus points for the model (!). I''ll give it an 8 because I think could be tilted to the right ever so slightly.', '2006-09-09 01:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816809, 389917, 62187, '<td valign="top">I kinda hate judging these...it just seems the goat is a little high (in the frame...doh!) and maybe it''s just me, but the trees seem in better focus then the body of the goat. Still...don''t let those things get yours...I like the photo...8</td>', 'I kinda hate judging these...it just seems the goat is a little high (in the frame...doh!) and maybe it''s just me, but the trees seem in better focus then the body of the goat. Still...don''t let those things get yours...I like the photo...8', '2006-09-09 01:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816818, 390930, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why you placed the subject in the lower left? Is that really fallow ground? Anyway...it''s a very nice photo...8</td>', 'I''m wondering why you placed the subject in the lower left? Is that really fallow ground? Anyway...it''s a very nice photo...8', '2006-09-09 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 1);
