(2816837, 391727, 62187, '<td valign="top">The colors and focus are excellent...I just think the berries, I''m guessing they are the subject...are too low in the frame.</td>', 'The colors and focus are excellent...I just think the berries, I''m guessing they are the subject...are too low in the frame.', '2006-09-09 01:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816841, 391325, 62187, '<td valign="top">For me, the placement of the second largest flower is perfect. It''s the closest one that is bothering me for some reason...sorry...I''m not much help.</td>', 'For me, the placement of the second largest flower is perfect. It''s the closest one that is bothering me for some reason...sorry...I''m not much help.', '2006-09-09 01:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816845, 391284, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...if everything besides the Moon is a rose, I''d have to say you''re very easy to please! };&gt;) I''m having trouble with the thirds...the whole thing seems kinda top-heavy to me...I''m not being very helpful in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow...if everything besides the Moon is a rose, I''d have to say you''re very easy to please! };>) I''m having trouble with the thirds...the whole thing seems kinda top-heavy to me...I''m not being very helpful in this challenge.', '2006-09-09 01:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816850, 391667, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm? Not sure if the rule works here. The dead-space seems to be where a subject should be? The focus and colors are nice...and since your photo is very similar to mine (don''t tell anybody!)...I''ll bump it up just bit more. 7</td>', 'Hmmm? Not sure if the rule works here. The dead-space seems to be where a subject should be? The focus and colors are nice...and since your photo is very similar to mine (don''t tell anybody!)...I''ll bump it up just bit more. 7', '2006-09-09 01:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2816851, 390599, 62187, '<td valign="top">The hard lines of the outter petals are strange and the texture behind the rose is odd...to me...but that''s not odd...I mean...I''m kinda odd. Hey, I like it better already and especially the blue color!</td>', 'The hard lines of the outter petals are strange and the texture behind the rose is odd...to me...but that''s not odd...I mean...I''m kinda odd. Hey, I like it better already and especially the blue color!', '2006-09-09 01:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
