(2816891, 391726, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow..great focus and color. I got ''stung'' by something that looked like that...we called ''em ''Asp''s''... hurt like heck! He seems a little to close the the center...maybe it''s the ''square'' frame that''s throwing me off?</td>', 'Wow..great focus and color. I got ''stung'' by something that looked like that...we called ''em ''Asp''s''... hurt like heck! He seems a little to close the the center...maybe it''s the ''square'' frame that''s throwing me off?', '2006-09-09 01:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
