(2819926, 391487, 28054, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this has already been commented on but the image is under exposed, you''ve lost detail in the blacks and retained detail in the whites in the background. Add a couple of stops of exposure next time, as this is a nice image which gives a real connection to the model and a good feeling of contemplation.</td>', 'I''m sure this has already been commented on but the image is under exposed, you''ve lost detail in the blacks and retained detail in the whites in the background. Add a couple of stops of exposure next time, as this is a nice image which gives a real connection to the model and a good feeling of contemplation.', '2006-09-10 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2819928, 391417, 28054, '<td valign="top">Great image, my only reservation is that the flowers seem to be lost in the background and don''t stand out enough for my liking. Well done though!</td>', 'Great image, my only reservation is that the flowers seem to be lost in the background and don''t stand out enough for my liking. Well done though!', '2006-09-10 11:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
