(2819934, 391200, 28054, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image which for me is let down slightly by the blurring of the child. I know this is meant to show motion, but a photographer once said to me if your trying to achieve an effect in an image, make sure it doesn''t look accidental. If you wanted blurred movement it should be more blurred, if you wanted to freeze the action it should be sharper. Please accept this as constructive criticism as I really do like this one :)</td>', 'This is an excellent image which for me is let down slightly by the blurring of the child. I know this is meant to show motion, but a photographer once said to me if your trying to achieve an effect in an image, make sure it doesn''t look accidental. If you wanted blurred movement it should be more blurred, if you wanted to freeze the action it should be sharper. Please accept this as constructive criticism as I really do like this one :)', '2006-09-10 11:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2819941, 390981, 38648, '<td valign="top">Best in Challenge IMO - 10</td>', 'Best in Challenge IMO - 10', '2006-09-10 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
