(2822889, 391241, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but it is not really fitting my definition of ROT. That a side there is a lot going on in this photo, very busy, and it is hard for me to find one thing to focus on. Also when shooting flowers you should pick the ones that are in pristine condition, here it looks like the bugs got a hold of them.</td>', 'Nice photo but it is not really fitting my definition of ROT. That a side there is a lot going on in this photo, very busy, and it is hard for me to find one thing to focus on. Also when shooting flowers you should pick the ones that are in pristine condition, here it looks like the bugs got a hold of them.', '2006-09-11 09:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2822902, 391022, 33515, '<td valign="top">Gee, did you get him to say cheese as well? Seems he was a very easy model to work with! Fits the challenge well and with his arms being out of focus it helps focus on the head. The brown background doesn''t help separate him from his surroundings much.</td>', 'Gee, did you get him to say cheese as well? Seems he was a very easy model to work with! Fits the challenge well and with his arms being out of focus it helps focus on the head. The brown background doesn''t help separate him from his surroundings much.', '2006-09-11 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
