(2827535, 391715, 50695, '<td valign="top">the black border creates a strange effect. since it is extending the darkness, it makes him look like the top half of his head is gone, or covered. but that''s a small matter. another small matter is the creases on his shirt. regardless of the cause, it makes the shirt look new which makes it seem like a "dramatization." It works against the illusion you''re creating. Everything else is fine, though. You''ve got a moody, noirish shot with a protagonist we want to know more about(for our own safety, perhaps).</td>', 'the black border creates a strange effect. since it is extending the darkness, it makes him look like the top half of his head is gone, or covered. but that''s a small matter. another small matter is the creases on his shirt. regardless of the cause, it makes the shirt look new which makes it seem like a "dramatization." It works against the illusion you''re creating. Everything else is fine, though. You''ve got a moody, noirish shot with a protagonist we want to know more about(for our own safety, perhaps).', '2006-09-12 12:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827541, 389921, 50695, '<td valign="top">um... your frog is almost centered. nice composition, though.</td>', 'um... your frog is almost centered. nice composition, though.', '2006-09-12 12:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
