(2827838, 390789, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, the twist of his head really makes this novel and spectacular.  The hard light works in your/his favor.  Great crispness, especially on the antlers.</td>', 'Wow, the twist of his head really makes this novel and spectacular.  The hard light works in your/his favor.  Great crispness, especially on the antlers.', '2006-09-12 14:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827843, 390506, 50695, '<td valign="top">this epitomizes the way a visual image can appeal to cognition. We see straw in hand and straw in mouth. Our cognition connects them, causing a sort of spark. Your composition is like building a fire to burn from that spark (hand in front of straw, face behind straw, knuckles on a thirds intersection, eyes on the opposite intersection). Well done.</td>', 'this epitomizes the way a visual image can appeal to cognition. We see straw in hand and straw in mouth. Our cognition connects them, causing a sort of spark. Your composition is like building a fire to burn from that spark (hand in front of straw, face behind straw, knuckles on a thirds intersection, eyes on the opposite intersection). Well done.', '2006-09-12 14:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827847, 390211, 50695, '<td valign="top">this gets my "lol 7". I love the expression in his eyes.</td>', 'this gets my "lol 7". I love the expression in his eyes.', '2006-09-12 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
