(2827863, 391408, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate waterdrops and I''m not crazy about grungy processing, but put them together and you''ve got awesomeness! cool composition, too.</td>', 'I hate waterdrops and I''m not crazy about grungy processing, but put them together and you''ve got awesomeness! cool composition, too.', '2006-09-12 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
