(2827894, 391240, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this with some advanced editing, so you can experiment with different kinds of fuzzing and obscuring effects. It''s good the way it is, but borders on being sentimental. I think what ultimately saves it is that the color and flow of the leaves draws just as much attention as the cross. 7</td>', 'I''d like to see this with some advanced editing, so you can experiment with different kinds of fuzzing and obscuring effects. It''s good the way it is, but borders on being sentimental. I think what ultimately saves it is that the color and flow of the leaves draws just as much attention as the cross. 7', '2006-09-12 14:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827902, 391082, 50695, '<td valign="top">raawwwwwkk!!! pretty photo!! pretty photo!! pretty colors!! pretty colors!! rawkkk!!! symphony of light!! symphony of light!!! rawkk!!! symphony of shadows!! symphony of shadows! rrrawwwwwkk</td>', 'raawwwwwkk!!! pretty photo!! pretty photo!! pretty colors!! pretty colors!! rawkkk!!! symphony of light!! symphony of light!!! rawkk!!! symphony of shadows!! symphony of shadows! rrrawwwwwkk', '2006-09-12 14:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827910, 390830, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s so hard to explain what is good or bad about a picture that works on a purely visual level. This one almost works for me. I think what''s detracting is all that light on the left. For some reason it makes me see the entire deck and it ruins the illusion that the whole world exists inside the frame. 6</td>', 'it''s so hard to explain what is good or bad about a picture that works on a purely visual level. This one almost works for me. I think what''s detracting is all that light on the left. For some reason it makes me see the entire deck and it ruins the illusion that the whole world exists inside the frame. 6', '2006-09-12 14:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2827915, 391072, 50695, '<td valign="top">I know you don''t have control over these things, but I want just a little more symmetry with the two figures: either both with heads or both without heads. 6</td>', 'I know you don''t have control over these things, but I want just a little more symmetry with the two figures: either both with heads or both without heads. 6', '2006-09-12 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
