(2828995, 391780, 60995, '<td valign="top">I''m going through and voting on all the other pictures just so i can give this one a high score.  It definitely meets the challenge and, even better, the rule of thirds is essential to the beauty of this photograph--many of the other pics could''ve been taken in any old way.  My only quibble is that the sky is a bit grainy, but who cares???  10.</td>', 'I''m going through and voting on all the other pictures just so i can give this one a high score.  It definitely meets the challenge and, even better, the rule of thirds is essential to the beauty of this photograph--many of the other pics could''ve been taken in any old way.  My only quibble is that the sky is a bit grainy, but who cares???  10.', '2006-09-12 21:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
