(2829142, 390550, 60995, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, but I wrestle with it meeting the rule of thirds.  As a whole, the man pretty much takes up the whole center of the picture--but you could argue that his face and his cane are the photo''s subjects and they are definitely in the thirds of the photograph.  Hmmm....I''ll think on it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, but I wrestle with it meeting the rule of thirds.  As a whole, the man pretty much takes up the whole center of the picture--but you could argue that his face and his cane are the photo''s subjects and they are definitely in the thirds of the photograph.  Hmmm....I''ll think on it.', '2006-09-12 21:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
