(2831483, 391154, 59847, '<td valign="top">Hi all, thanks for voting and commenting.<br/>The triple bubble was a fluke and just happened, I did not try to put them together. I had to put the ISO at 800 to get the light to focus hence the noise, particularly since I also had to crop the image. As to the the rule of thirds it is our own interpretation and all of us have a slightly different point of view and liking and I agree, it is not perfectly 1/3 in all directions. I would have rotated the image but the the reflection in the bubble would have been skewed and looked unatural. The bubbles and the colors are the interest and focal point in this photo. I''m still learning and looking to develop some kind of knowledge and wisdom to get those catchy images.<br/>Thanks for looking!<br/>Christian</td>', 'Hi all, thanks for voting and commenting.The triple bubble was a fluke and just happened, I did not try to put them together. I had to put the ISO at 800 to get the light to focus hence the noise, particularly since I also had to crop the image. As to the the rule of thirds it is our own interpretation and all of us have a slightly different point of view and liking and I agree, it is not perfectly 1/3 in all directions. I would have rotated the image but the the reflection in the bubble would have been skewed and looked unatural. The bubbles and the colors are the interest and focal point in this photo. I''m still learning and looking to develop some kind of knowledge and wisdom to get those catchy images.Thanks for looking!Christian', '2006-09-13 12:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2831507, 391570, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m usually cool with noise, but this had a kind of overshapened low-contrast look that didn''t work for me (I have no idea why sometimes I love it and sometimes I don''t). But I still gave it a 6 for good composition and a wonderful subject. Those tigers have so much personality. This pic is growing on me!</td>', 'I''m usually cool with noise, but this had a kind of overshapened low-contrast look that didn''t work for me (I have no idea why sometimes I love it and sometimes I don''t). But I still gave it a 6 for good composition and a wonderful subject. Those tigers have so much personality. This pic is growing on me!', '2006-09-13 12:23:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2831528, 391432, 54602, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised at this too. I really don''t see how some people honestly could give it a 1, 2, or 3. <br/> <br/>I love it and really expected it to place top 10 at least.</td>', 'I''m surprised at this too. I really don''t see how some people honestly could give it a 1, 2, or 3.  I love it and really expected it to place top 10 at least.', '2006-09-13 12:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
