(2831760, 391432, 61012, '<td valign="top">Nice Work!<br/> <br/>I would have scored this image higher but I was momentarily confused as to whether the B&amp;G were "dancing alone" or if the blonde woman nearly facing the camera was dancing alone. Obviously you mean the couple but my eye was drawn to the woman equally as much.<br/> <br/>In the version you posted here... <br/> <br/>//static.flickr.com/90/233992685_2b07b2a1d4_o.jpg<br/> <br/>the other woman doesn''t stand out as much and the couple is the obvious focal point. I can see you cropped it for ROT but the original image is much better to me.<br/></td>', 'Nice Work! I would have scored this image higher but I was momentarily confused as to whether the B&G were "dancing alone" or if the blonde woman nearly facing the camera was dancing alone. Obviously you mean the couple but my eye was drawn to the woman equally as much. In the version you posted here...  //static.flickr.com/90/233992685_2b07b2a1d4_o.jpg the other woman doesn''t stand out as much and the couple is the obvious focal point. I can see you cropped it for ROT but the original image is much better to me.', '2006-09-13 13:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2831798, 391774, 42100, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the winning of your ribbon.  Great photo!  LOL, there''s no way I would of got that close to that snake.  Hard to believe how really close all three of us were in final score.</td>', 'Congratulations on the winning of your ribbon.  Great photo!  LOL, there''s no way I would of got that close to that snake.  Hard to believe how really close all three of us were in final score.', '2006-09-13 13:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2831808, 390965, 42100, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the winning of another ribbon.  Great photo!  How did you ever find someone that would pose in cold, freezing water!  I can''t believe how really close all three of us were in the final score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-13 12:52:55.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the winning of another ribbon.  Great photo!  How did you ever find someone that would pose in cold, freezing water!  I can''t believe how really close all three of us were in the final score.', '2006-09-13 13:52:04.000000', '2006-09-13 13:52:55.000000', 0),
(2831875, 390970, 10080, '<td valign="top">I see blue skys! I love it. Wonderful composition, and a big congrats on your first ribbon. I am sure many will soon follow.<br/>B</td>', 'I see blue skys! I love it. Wonderful composition, and a big congrats on your first ribbon. I am sure many will soon follow.B', '2006-09-13 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2831888, 391636, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and surreal.  This would be so amazing on a wall as a poster!</td>', 'Gorgeous and surreal.  This would be so amazing on a wall as a poster!', '2006-09-13 14:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
