(2832037, 391636, 42792, '<td valign="top">Love how you pushed the boundaries of representing the 3 elements.  So out of this world :), yet so within it.  Deserved higher IMO (ROT is spot on).</td>', 'Love how you pushed the boundaries of representing the 3 elements.  So out of this world :), yet so within it.  Deserved higher IMO (ROT is spot on).', '2006-09-13 14:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832103, 391515, 27763, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Fantastic moon shot!  And I enjoyed reading your photographer''s comments, too ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  Fantastic moon shot!  And I enjoyed reading your photographer''s comments, too ;) ', '2006-09-13 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832108, 390970, 48954, '<td valign="top">Yes, same to you, congrats for the ribbon and yes, i can''t believe how close we both were to the same score. But your shot definitly out does mine i think.It''s more deserving of the blue. Great work and it was pleasure competing against you. ;)</td>', 'Yes, same to you, congrats for the ribbon and yes, i can''t believe how close we both were to the same score. But your shot definitly out does mine i think.It''s more deserving of the blue. Great work and it was pleasure competing against you. ;)', '2006-09-13 15:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832187, 390970, 52467, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue..Nice image!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue..Nice image!', '2006-09-13 15:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832214, 391774, 42871, '<td valign="top">Did you use 2 strobes? One strobe set low (the ''bottom one) and the other set at perhaps a 45 degree angle (the ''top'' one)? I ask becuase I think lighting is probably my weakest skill right now so I try and figure out what lighting was used for pictures I really like, such as this one.</td>', 'Did you use 2 strobes? One strobe set low (the ''bottom one) and the other set at perhaps a 45 degree angle (the ''top'' one)? I ask becuase I think lighting is probably my weakest skill right now so I try and figure out what lighting was used for pictures I really like, such as this one.', '2006-09-13 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832242, 391774, 20539, '<td valign="top">good job smyk, congrats on your first ribbon.<br/>nice snake by the way ;)</td>', 'good job smyk, congrats on your first ribbon.nice snake by the way ;)', '2006-09-13 16:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832405, 390970, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is really, really beautiful, Mark. Congratulations on both your ribbon and personal best! The colors are just wonderful - so very rich. The two baloons in the distance make this image, in my opinion because of the feeling of almost vertigo they add. Wonderful find and even better processing. You knew when was enough and what was just right. That''s a really impressive talent. Way to go!! (and a new fave for me)</td>', 'This is really, really beautiful, Mark. Congratulations on both your ribbon and personal best! The colors are just wonderful - so very rich. The two baloons in the distance make this image, in my opinion because of the feeling of almost vertigo they add. Wonderful find and even better processing. You knew when was enough and what was just right. That''s a really impressive talent. Way to go!! (and a new fave for me)', '2006-09-13 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832420, 390970, 28532, '<td valign="top">This is such an excellent shot!! Very Beautiful ~ Congrats on 1st!!!</td>', 'This is such an excellent shot!! Very Beautiful ~ Congrats on 1st!!!', '2006-09-13 17:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2832531, 388235, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the 4th place, excellent shot!</td>', 'Congratulations on the 4th place, excellent shot!', '2006-09-13 17:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
