(2905381, 388968, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a delightful shot.  You''ve got your cat.  You''ve got your fish.  You''ve got your cat who can clearly see it''s target and yet knows it can''t get there from here.  You''ve got your fish who''s completely oblivious to the cat.  Or is it?  Is it perhaps gloating, knowing what the cat knows, that the cat can''t get there from here.<br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'This is a delightful shot.  You''ve got your cat.  You''ve got your fish.  You''ve got your cat who can clearly see it''s target and yet knows it can''t get there from here.  You''ve got your fish who''s completely oblivious to the cat.  Or is it?  Is it perhaps gloating, knowing what the cat knows, that the cat can''t get there from here. Great shot!', '2006-10-07 10:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
