(3583406, 391728, 66384, '<td valign="top">I was thinking exactly the same thing as Ursula -- love the freckles. Like the hair too. Really cute girls. <br/> <br/>As for the rule of thirds, it is hard to see here, but except in a rule of thirds challenge, that doesn''t matter -- not meant to be seen. The benefit of the rule of thirds is good composition, and that has worked in this case.</td>', 'I was thinking exactly the same thing as Ursula -- love the freckles. Like the hair too. Really cute girls.  As for the rule of thirds, it is hard to see here, but except in a rule of thirds challenge, that doesn''t matter -- not meant to be seen. The benefit of the rule of thirds is good composition, and that has worked in this case.', '2007-04-25 22:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
